Enrolment Rates
The Gross Enrolment Rate (GER) for primary level is 105 percent, whilst the Net Enrolment Rate (NER) is 65
percent. At the SSS level, the GER is 48 percent and the NER is 14 percent.
Literacy
Figure 1.7 shows that out of the population aged 10 years and above, 51.4 percent are literate in any
language. The literacy rate for males is 59.4 percent, compared to 43.9 percent for females. The results
also show that 44.2% percent are literate in English Language only, while 2.6 percent are literate in a local
language, and 5 percent are literate in two or more languages.

